Package: minpdf
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: ghostscript, poppler-utils, zenity | kdialog, python3-nautilus, python3-nautilus, python3-nautilus, python3-nautilus, python3-nautilus, python3-nautilus, python3-nautilus, python3-nautilus
Recommends: nautilus | dolphin
Maintainer: Max Haase <maxhaase@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/maxhaase/minPDF
Description: Multi-use utility for PDF files
 Compress and merge PDF files while preserving color and quality.
 Integrates with GNOME Files (Nautilus) and KDE Dolphin through
 right-click context menus.
